        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Examples — Appendix A–13</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #000;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1700px;\n    height: 2200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .header,\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .header-left {\n    top: 89px;\n    left: 176px;\n  }\n\n  .header-right {\n    top: 89px;\n    right: 181px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-left {\n    bottom: 87px;\n    left: 187px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-right {\n    right: 186px;\n    bottom: 81px;\n  }\n\n  .block {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 178px;\n    width: 1350px;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    line-height: 1.17;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  .line {\n    min-height: 32.75px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .label {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .heading {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 263px;\n    width: 1260px;\n    font-size: 29px;\n    line-height: 1.08;\n    font-style: normal;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .heading.first {\n    left: 292px;\n  }\n\n  .intro {\n    top: 194px;\n  }\n\n  .intro .gap {\n    height: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .heading-identification {\n    top: 634px;\n  }\n\n  .identification-example {\n    top: 684px;\n  }\n\n  .heading-glide {\n    top: 758px;\n  }\n\n  .glide-examples {\n    top: 806px;\n  }\n\n  .heading-ils {\n    top: 916px;\n  }\n\n  .ils-examples {\n    top: 964px;\n  }\n\n  .ils-note-one {\n    top: 1331px;\n  }\n\n  .ils-classification-example {\n    top: 1406px;\n  }\n\n  .ils-note-two {\n    top: 1481px;\n  }\n\n  .heading-localizer {\n    top: 1557px;\n  }\n\n  .localizer-examples {\n    top: 1604px;\n  }\n\n  .localizer-note {\n    top: 1938px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"header header-left\">8/10/25</div>\n  <div class=\"header header-right\">7930.2U CHG 1</div>\n\n  <section class=\"block intro\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">In this example, the NDB is not operational, but the marker beacon is operational.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…JOSIE MKR BCN U/S</div>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">In this example, only the marker beacon is unserviceable; the NDB is operational.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLES–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">!MCI MCI NAV ILS RWY 09 HUGGY LOM U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">FLV FLV NAV HUGGY NDB U/S…</div>\n\n    <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">In the above examples, Huggy NDB serves as a LOM to runway 9 at Kansas City Intl (MCI). It also serves Fort</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Leavenworth/Sherman AAF (FLV), Kansas, as an NDB.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"heading first heading-identification\">(2) [h]&nbsp;&nbsp;NAVAID identification change.</div>\n\n  <section class=\"block identification-example\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV VORTAC ID CHANGED TO VHP…</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"heading heading-glide\">(d)&nbsp;&nbsp;Visual Glide Slope Indicator.</div>\n\n  <section class=\"block glide-examples\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLES–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…RWY 18 PAPI BEYOND 6DEG LEFT OF RCL UNUSABLE…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…RWY 32 PAPI BEYOND 2.8NM UNUSABLE…</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"heading heading-ils\">(f)&nbsp;&nbsp;Instrument Landing Systems (ILS).&nbsp;&nbsp;Precision.</div>\n\n  <section class=\"block ils-examples\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLES–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 35L U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 32 110.3 COMMISSIONED…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 08R SNOOP LOM U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 05 U/S… –PERM</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 18 DME U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 02 FAN MKR U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 18 GP UNUSABLE SFC–768FT …</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 02 GP/OM/MM U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 30 GP UNUSABLE BEYOND 5DEG LEFT OF COURSE …</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV BZB ILS RWY 22R U/S…</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block ils-note-one\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">Offset ILS are issued with the 3 letter ID (example BZB) for the localizer after the Keyword NAV.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block ils-classification-example\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 30 FAC PER CLASSIFICATION CODE CHANGED TO CLASS IIIE…</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block ils-note-two\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">For runway 30, the ILS facility performance classification code has been changed from the previously published data.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"heading heading-localizer\">(g)&nbsp;&nbsp;Localizer/LOC Directional Aid/Simplified Directional Facility Azimuth.</div>\n\n  <section class=\"block localizer-examples\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">EXAMPLES–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 30 LOC RTS…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 35L U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 12 LOC UNUSABLE BEYOND 4DEG RIGHT OF COURSE …</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV ILS RWY 12 LOC UNUSABLE BEYOND RWY THR…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV LOC RWY 27 U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV LOC RWY 33 LOC UNUSABLE WI .4NM …</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV LOC RWY 16 BC UNUSABLE BEYOND 6DEG RIGHT OF COURSE…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV LOC TYPE DIRECTIONAL AID U/S…</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">…NAV LOC RWY 14 LOC/DME U/S…</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"block localizer-note\">\n    <div class=\"line label\">NOTE–</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">The LDA at the airport, not a particular runway, is unserviceable.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"footer footer-left\">Examples</div>\n  <div class=\"footer footer-right\">Appendix A–13</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
